    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Summary Co-Pilot\r\n\r\nThis AI Chat will take information and summarize it into the main ideas.\r\n\r\n#### Try one of the following:\r\n\r\n* Paste a text from another assignment or webpage into the chat\r\n\r\nOR\r\n\r\n* Click [**Add File**] in the chat box, click **From Library**, and select one of the files to summarize.\r\n\r\nOR\r\n\r\n* Click the **microphone button** and talk for as long as you want about something interesting to you. \r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
